Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "Wow, there are so many Gates of Souls...
We have to close them right away!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "Watch out! There are weird monsters
guarding the Gates!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "I bet those monsters are being controlled by the
Gates. We defeat them and it'll close the Gates!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "You tackle the enemies in the northern desert!
We'll stop any from crossing the bridge!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "The enemies just keep coming!
We're done for!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "Just as I thought. Defeating the monsters
closes the Gates. Keep at it, everyone!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "What's that? Whoa! A huge bird just
came out of the sky!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "It's probably looking for somewhere to
roost. Leave it. We have other problems!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "OK, while the bird is taking it easy...
Run away!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Who? Where did you come from?",
  "1.0.10.0" => "I sprouted wings and flew here. What do
you think? That bird kidnapped me!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "Oops, and now it's awake and sees me again.
I could use some help here!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "I didn't fully understand that, but yeah,
I can help.",
  "1.0.13.0" => "Oh no! Tetra's being attack by the
great bird again! We have to save her!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Link! We need to drive off that bird!
Could you help?",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Phew... Glad that's over, for now at least.",
  "1.0.16.0" => "Kya! Worms come to play!
We eats them!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "The lizard men spotted us. Looks like
we're right back into battle!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "That about cleans up this area.",
  "1.0.19.0" => "I need to close the Gate of Souls!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Gya! Ruin their base!
Make them sssssuffer!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "They...so ssssstrong!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "We shouldn't be seeing any new monsters
for a while. Progress!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Now, let's go rescue that kid!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Hya? Bird fight the humanssss?",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Now is chance!
Drive out humansss!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "The desert monsters are getting
all uppity! Watch out!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "I think they're trying to use the great
bird as a means to drive us out!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "That stupid bird... Let's pay it back for
all the trouble it's caused us!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Great. It looks like the buzzard is
feeling better. Just what we need.",
  "1.0.30.0" => "We should take the keep it's using as
a nest. That'll put a stop to its roosting!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Now it shouldn't be able to
get away!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Hya! Humans, go away!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "That little nap really did wonders for
the bird. It's looking pretty fierce now!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "That bird is way too confident! Let's
hurry and take its nest away!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "We have to take that nest away from it!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "I was right about taking its nest.
Now it's got nowhere to run!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "We can finally relax!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Don't slack off yet. The land is still pretty
messed up, and YOU need to fix it.",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Right. We didn't learn anything here,
but we need to locate Cia.",
  "1.0.40.0" => "No! They've taken our base!
We're done for...",
  "1.0.41.0" => "That bird is making all the monsters go
wild! We've got to settle them down!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "Then let's do it.",
  "1.0.43.0" => "Time for a little payback!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Stupid bird... It's got guts to toss me
into a desert, I'll give it that.",
  "1.0.45.0" => "Hey! Lana's here! Awesome! She can help
use her magic to defeat that bird!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Hey, didn't you guys have something
else you needed to do?",
}